WEBVTT

00:10:28.476 --> 00:10:30.916
or take a break or whatever it is,

00:10:30.916 --> 00:10:33.796
you lose on average
40 percent of your income.

00:10:34.196 --> 00:10:38.116
The good news now is
that there's algorithms

00:10:38.156 --> 00:10:39.476
and people that can come in

00:10:39.516 --> 00:10:41.676
and literally root out
the motherhood penalty.

00:10:41.676 --> 00:10:45.116
So the number one thing is,
is when you go in there and you ask,

00:10:45.156 --> 00:10:47.676
you want to know what he is making.

00:10:47.676 --> 00:10:51.516
You know what I mean, and you want
to make the same or more.

00:10:51.916 --> 00:10:53.276
I think the second thing is,

00:10:53.316 --> 00:10:58.436
is we have to start asking
for our companies

00:10:58.476 --> 00:11:00.596
to pay for childcare benefits.